# Local development secrets for Cloudflare Workers.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (never commit) for `pnpm preview:cloudflare` / `wrangler dev`.
#
# NOTE: API_URL / WEB_URL / NEXT_PUBLIC_* are read at BUILD time by Next.js,
# so for local previews set them when running the build step instead:
#   API_URL=http://localhost:4000 WEB_URL=http://localhost:3000 pnpm build:cloudflare
# then `pnpm preview:cloudflare`.

# Runtime (non-secret) vars are already declared in wrangler.jsonc -> "vars".
# Secrets go here, e.g.:
# API_KEY=your-secret-here
